- I can't. Gracie, look, for whatever it's worth....

1153
01:14:05,975 --> 01:14:09,843
Look, for whatever it's worth, Cohen had
nothing to do with us. Not for one second.

1154
01:14:10,012 --> 01:14:11,240
Don't run. Just stay.

1155
01:14:14,083 --> 01:14:15,345
Can I help you fellas?

1156
01:14:15,518 --> 01:14:18,578
- We'll get to you in a minute.
- We wanna talk to her, is all.

1157
01:14:18,754 --> 01:14:21,279
Hey, we got a message from Mr. Cohen.

1158
01:14:21,457 --> 01:14:24,085
It just seems like the lady
doesn't want to talk to you.

1159
01:14:24,260 --> 01:14:27,752
What lady? She's just one of Mickey's
pro skirts, there, pal.

1160
01:14:35,204 --> 01:14:36,193
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
Where is it?

1161
01:14:36,372 --> 01:14:38,272
- Where is it?<font color="#808080">
HERBERT:</font> It's over there!

1162
01:14:39,175 --> 01:14:42,303
- Ah-ah-ah. No, no, no.
- What is that?

1163
01:14:42,478 --> 01:14:44,742
Is that your message for her?
Is that acid?

1164
01:14:44,947 --> 01:14:48,178
- Oh, come on.
- I ever see you near her again, I'll kill you.

1165
01:14:48,351 --> 01:14:50,182
- Okay.
- Good.

1166
01:14:50,386 --> 01:14:52,183
<font color="#D900D9">(SCREAMING)</font>

1167
01:14:53,689 --> 01:14:55,316
Damn it!

1168
01:14:55,658 --> 01:14:57,148
Fuck!

1169
01:14:57,660 --> 01:15:00,060
You're gonna get yours! Aah! Aah!

1170
01:15:01,697 --> 01:15:04,860
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font> We know Cohen's sending
Wrevock here to meet the shipment.

1171
01:15:05,034 --> 01:15:08,367
Maintain surveillance until he reaches
the target location.

1172
01:15:08,538 --> 01:15:10,506
He's gonna lead us right to the dope.

1173
01:15:10,673 --> 01:15:15,633
We get this shipment, it's over.
No more business.

1174
01:15:15,811 --> 01:15:18,371
A lot of civilians, this goes south.

1175
01:15:18,548 --> 01:15:22,484
Let's make sure that doesn't happen.
Come on.

1176
01:15:24,020 --> 01:15:27,217
- Where's Wooters?
- Wasn't my turn to watch him.

1177
01:15:29,091 --> 01:15:30,752
<font color="#808080">MAN:</font> <font color="#D900D9">(ON RADIO)</font>
<i>We're ready to go now for round 9...</i>

1178
01:15:30,927 --> 01:15:33,128
<i>...of the scheduled 15-round
lightweight championship...</i>

1179
01:15:33,296 --> 01:15:34,422
<font color="#D900D9">(KNOCKING ON DOOR)</font>

1180
01:15:34,597 --> 01:15:36,724
<i>...in the Olympic Auditorium,
Los Angeles, California.</i>

1181
01:15:44,907 --> 01:15:46,932
Jerry. Grace.

1182
01:15:47,109 --> 01:15:48,269
Come on in.

1183
01:15:48,444 --> 01:15:50,002
Come on, quick.

1184
01:15:58,220 --> 01:15:59,812
I gotta ask you a favor.

1185
01:16:00,189 --> 01:16:02,214
I need you to get Gracie
out of town tonight.

1186
01:16:02,625 --> 01:16:03,819
Yeah.

1187
01:16:05,127 --> 01:16:06,253
I can do that.

1188
01:16:07,330 --> 01:16:08,388
Thank you.

1189
01:16:09,632 --> 01:16:10,621
I gotta go.

1190
01:16:26,916 --> 01:16:28,543
<font color="#808080">MAN:</font>
Are you guys sisters?

1191
01:16:28,718 --> 01:16:30,151
<font color="#808080">WOMAN:</font>
We can be.

1192
01:16:30,353 --> 01:16:31,945
<font color="#D900D9">(MAN AND WOMEN LAUGHING)</font>

1193
01:16:32,221 --> 01:16:34,485
- Wait here in case he doubles back.
- Got it.

1194
01:16:41,230 --> 01:16:42,390
<font color="#D900D9">(MAN SPEAKS IN CHINESE)</font>

1195
01:16:44,233 --> 01:16:45,632
<font color="#D900D9">(FIRECRACKERS EXPLODING)</font>

1196
01:17:17,800 --> 01:17:19,097
<font color="#D900D9">(FIRECRACKERS EXPLODING)</font>

1197
01:17:58,040 --> 01:17:59,701
