01:18:04,880 --> 01:18:06,142
Where's John?

1200
01:18:23,365 --> 01:18:24,354
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
John!

1201
01:18:25,367 --> 01:18:27,164
John! John!

1202
01:18:28,003 --> 01:18:29,971
