1203
01:18:35,010 --> 01:18:37,035
<font color="#D900D9">(GUNSHOTS AND PEOPLE SCREAMING)</font>

1204
01:18:39,915 --> 01:18:41,177
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
John, look out!

1205
01:18:48,190 --> 01:18:49,555
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE SCREAMING)</font>

1206
01:18:57,900 --> 01:19:00,391
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE SCREAMING)</font>

1207
01:19:26,428 --> 01:19:28,055
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE SCREAMING)</font>

1208
01:19:37,907 --> 01:19:39,602
- You okay?
- Yeah, I'm all right.

1209
01:19:56,759 --> 01:19:58,124
Fuck!

1210
01:20:02,298 --> 01:20:03,765
Oh, Jesus.

1211
01:20:04,099 --> 01:20:05,088
Keeler.

1212
01:20:05,768 --> 01:20:10,171
<font color="#808080">COHEN:</font> <font color="#D900D9">(OVER RADIO)</font> <i>I was 9 years old when
I robbed the Palace Theater with a baseball bat.</i>

1213
01:20:11,140 --> 01:20:13,108
<i>Cashier was laughing.</i>

1214
01:20:14,210 --> 01:20:16,144
Till I bashed his head in.

1215
01:20:17,379 --> 01:20:19,711
Knocking the place over,
that wasn't the hard part.

1216
01:20:19,882 --> 01:20:22,282
A 9-year-old kid with a cash box...

1217
01:20:22,451 --> 01:20:25,386
...trying to get from Broadway
all the way to Boyle Heights?

1218
01:20:25,955 --> 01:20:29,152
<i>Every block, I must have fought five,
six kids for that box.</i>

1219
01:20:29,325 --> 01:20:32,852
But I wouldn't let it go. I wouldn't
let anybody take it away from me.

1220
01:20:34,897 --> 01:20:37,365
But you know who finally got that box?

1221
01:20:42,504 --> 01:20:43,664
A cop.

1222
01:20:44,607 --> 01:20:46,234
<i>A dirty cop.</i>

1223
01:20:46,976 --> 01:20:49,501
<i>An eavesdropping fucking cop.</i>

1224
