Don't you worry, Grace.

1234
01:21:45,467 --> 01:21:46,934
I'll get you out of town safe.

1235
01:21:47,102 --> 01:21:49,627
I don't want out of town, Jack.
I want out of this life.

1236
01:21:49,805 --> 01:21:52,603
Jack. Ha, ha, ha.

1237
01:21:55,044 --> 01:21:56,739
- You stay here.
- Jack.

1238
01:22:03,185 --> 01:22:04,379
<font color="#808080">COHEN:</font>
Where is she, Jack?

1239
01:22:04,787 --> 01:22:07,551
Where's that gorgeous red snatch?

1240
01:22:07,923 --> 01:22:09,049
She's not here, Mickey.

1241
01:22:09,224 --> 01:22:11,818
Did you bring your trouble boys
just to see Grace?

1242
01:22:11,994 --> 01:22:13,757
You expecting some trouble, Mickey?

1243
01:22:14,263 --> 01:22:15,423
You looking for some?

1244
01:22:15,597 --> 01:22:17,565
My dog, Mickey, Jr...

1245
01:22:17,967 --> 01:22:20,595
...he shits more trouble
than you're gonna give me.

1246
01:22:20,769 --> 01:22:22,498
We'll see about that, huh?

1247
01:22:22,771 --> 01:22:23,999
Make it good, boys, huh?

1248
01:22:24,206 --> 01:22:25,195
You? You?

1249
01:22:29,778 --> 01:22:32,440
<font color="#D900D9">(MEN GRUNTING)</font>

1250
01:22:32,648 --> 01:22:33,979
<font color="#808080">JACK:</font>
Come here.

1251
01:22:40,289 --> 01:22:42,154
You're up next, you little creep.

1252
01:22:43,092 --> 01:22:45,526
I've been saving something special
for you, Mickey.

1253
01:22:46,996 --> 01:22:49,726
My boxing days are over, Jack.

1254
01:22:50,733 --> 01:22:53,293
Come on, Mickey. Unh!

1255
01:22:58,974 --> 01:23:01,135
<font color="#808080">COHEN:</font> Does that hurt?
- Fuck you, Mickey.

1256
01:23:06,181 --> 01:23:07,341
<font color="#D900D9">(GUNSHOT)</font>

1257
01:23:07,649 --> 01:23:08,638
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

1258
01:23:30,172 --> 01:23:31,469
Argh!

1259
01:23:50,225 --> 01:23:51,351
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
John.

1260
01:23:52,194 --> 01:23:54,835
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font> Damn it, John, don't do this.<font color="#808080">
O'MARA:</font> Stay out of it, Jerry.

1261
01:23:54,997 --> 01:23:55,986
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
Just listen to me.

1262
01:23:57,232 --> 01:24:00,998
You goddamn suicidal son of a bitch.
You want to hit something, you hit me.

1263
01:24:01,170 --> 01:24:03,604
- Get out of my way!
- You want to hit something, hit...

1264
01:24:12,881 --> 01:24:14,314
Mickey!

1265
01:24:14,850 --> 01:24:16,078
Cohen!

1266
01:24:17,586 --> 01:24:19,076
Come on!

1267
01:24:35,037 --> 01:24:36,402
Well, sarge...

1268
01:24:39,074 --> 01:24:40,837
...this is where I get off.

1269
01:26:03,859 --> 01:26:08,421
The papers are calling for my resignation.

1270
01:26:09,231 --> 01:26:13,327
And the mayor, I'm afraid,
is calling for your head.

1271
01:26:14,169 --> 01:26:18,230
I will likely be replaced by someone
more amenable to Cohen.

1272
01:26:18,840 --> 01:26:22,640
And you, sergeant,
you'll be relieved of your duty.

1273
01:26:23,245 --> 01:26:27,341
Your career with the Los Angeles
Police Department is over.

1274
01:26:29,952 --> 01:26:31,579
As for your comrades...

1275
01:26:31,753 --> 01:26:33,721
They were following my orders, sir.

1276
01:26:34,957 --> 01:26:36,356
Blame rests solely with me.

1277
01:26:40,062 --> 01:26:42,223
You've served with distinction.

1278
01:26:43,265 --> 01:26:44,664
I'm sorry, John.

1279
01:26:45,534 --> 01:26:46,899
He won.

1280
01:27:15,364 --> 01:27:17,093
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font> Here, come here.
- No.

1281
01:27:17,266 --> 01:27:19,894
It's okay, it's okay. It's okay.

1282
01:27:21,570 --> 01:27:23,060
<font color="#D900D9">(SOBBING)</font>

1283
01:27:42,624 --> 01:27:44,922
If I leave, Keeler died for nothing.

1284
01:27:45,093 --> 01:27:48,585
Is that what you want me to tell our son
when he asks about his father?

1285
01:28:01,610 --> 01:28:02,599
Connie!

1286
01:28:21,463 --> 01:28:23,556
<font color="#D900D9">(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)</font>

1287
01:28:42,317 --> 01:28:44,376
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
The war taught us how to fight.

1288
01:28:45,787 --> 01:28:47,778
And, God knows, it was worth it.

1289
01:28:50,092 --> 01:28:53,459
But now it's all I know how to do.

1290
01:28:54,663 --> 01:28:56,528
I don't know how to live.

1291
01:28:57,966 --> 01:28:59,729
I just know how to fight.

1292
01:29:03,672 --> 01:29:05,401
Might as well be Mickey Cohen.

1293
01:29:06,641 --> 01:29:08,233
You're a good man, John.

1294
01:29:09,244 --> 01:29:11,542
You might even be a fucking angel.

1295
01:29:18,920 --> 01:29:20,751
Either way you're a hero.

1296
01:29:22,691 --> 01:29:26,889
You lose everything and you win the war...

1297
01:29:27,062 --> 01:29:28,359
...you're a hero.

1298
01:29:30,499 --> 01:29:33,866
You lose everything and you lose the war...

1299
01:29:39,274 --> 01:29:40,866
...you're just a fool.

1300
01:30:09,971 --> 01:30:12,166
I've been looking for you everywhere.

1301
01:30:15,877 --> 01:30:16,969
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
Gracie.

1302
01:30:19,948 --> 01:30:22,610
- I heard about Jack and I just thought....
- I know.

1303
01:30:27,255 --> 01:30:28,688
Jack saved my life.

1304
01:30:29,491 --> 01:30:30,981
He fought like hell.

1305
01:30:32,127 --> 01:30:33,890
What are you doing here?

1306
01:30:35,497 --> 01:30:37,260
I saw Cohen kill him.

1307
01:30:37,933 --> 01:30:40,663
Well, that's all the more reason
for you to get out of here.

1308
01:30:40,836 --> 01:30:42,167
No, I'm a witness.

1309
01:30:42,337 --> 01:30:44,328
- Gracie. Listen to me...
- I'm a witness.

1310
01:30:44,506 --> 01:30:46,406
I'm your witness, Jerry.

1311
01:30:48,777 --> 01:30:50,074
Gracie.

1312
01:30:50,412 --> 01:30:51,811
Let me.

1313
01:31:03,158 --> 01:31:05,285
Excuse me. Do I know you?

1314
01:31:05,460 --> 01:31:06,757
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
Need a favor, judge.

1315
01:31:06,928 --> 01:31:09,954
See, we've been bugging Cohen's house
for a while now.

1316
01:31:10,131 --> 01:31:13,828
Which I understand is illegal
and inadmissible in court.

1317
01:31:14,002 --> 01:31:16,596
But we don't think the papers
are gonna be so choosy.

1318
01:31:16,771 --> 01:31:20,138
Mickey's boys get pinched, you cut
them loose, he pays you in whores.

1319
01:31:20,308 --> 01:31:22,367
- That sound familiar?
- What do you want?

1320
01:31:22,544 --> 01:31:24,375
You're gonna retire, judge.

1321
01:31:24,546 --> 01:31:26,741
But before you do, just this once...

1322
01:31:27,282 --> 01:31:29,182
...you're gonna do something right.

1323
01:31:30,619 --> 01:31:31,608
Sign it.

1324
01:31:32,187 --> 01:31:33,745
Come on, sign it.

1325
01:31:36,825 --> 01:31:39,316
I hope you boys know
what you're getting into.

1326
01:31:40,195 --> 01:31:41,560
Where is he?

1327
01:31:41,763 --> 01:31:44,129
He's holed up at the Park Plaza Hotel.

1328
01:31:44,299 --> 01:31:48,030
Rented out every room in the place
and it's a fortress.

1329
01:31:48,203 --> 01:31:50,068
You'll never get him out of there.

1330
01:31:53,041 --> 01:31:54,838
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
<i>Tomorrow, they'll take my badge.</i>

1331
01:31:55,810 --> 01:31:57,471
Tonight, I'm still a cop.

1332
01:31:58,413 --> 01:32:02,349
I have here an arrest warrant for
Mickey Cohen for the crime of murder.

1333
01:32:04,219 --> 01:32:05,686
I'm bringing him in.

1334
01:32:06,054 --> 01:32:08,352
Think I'll tag along
if you don't mind, sarge.

1335
01:32:09,658 --> 01:32:11,523
I got no plans tonight.

1336
01:32:12,861 --> 01:32:13,850
I'm in.

1337
01:32:14,095 --> 01:32:15,357
Let's finish it.

1338
01:32:20,035 --> 01:32:22,515
<font color="#D900D9">(HOAGY CARMICHAEL'S "OLE BUTTERMILK
SKY" PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS)</font>

1339
01:32:22,671 --> 01:32:24,866
<i>Ole buttermilk sky
I'm telling you why</i>

1340
01:32:25,040 --> 01:32:28,532
<i>Now you know
Keep it in mind tonight</i>

1341
01:32:28,710 --> 01:32:32,510
I just got off the phone with Judge Carter.
He says he signed the warrant himself.

1342
01:32:32,681 --> 01:32:34,239
Who's gonna serve it?

1343
01:32:34,416 --> 01:32:36,316
Five guys? Forget it.

1344
01:32:37,018 --> 01:32:38,713
They'll never get through the lobby.

1345
01:32:50,599 --> 01:32:52,066
<font color="#808080">MAN 1:</font> Beat it.<font color="#808080">
MAN 2:</font> Get inside.

1346
01:32:58,907 --> 01:33:01,569
Think I'll dance with the one
what brung me.

1347
01:33:05,580 --> 01:33:07,104
Mickey Cohen...

1348
01:33:07,983 --> 01:33:12,113
...this is Sergeant John O'Mara of the
Los Angeles Police Department.

1349
01:33:12,587 --> 01:33:14,350
We have a warrant for your arrest.

1350
01:33:14,990 --> 01:33:19,791
Come out quietly with your hands up
and you will not be harmed.

1351
01:33:20,996 --> 01:33:24,227
Mickey Cohen,
this is your final warning.

1352
01:33:24,399 --> 01:33:26,492
I like having only one fork.

1353
01:33:27,636 --> 01:33:29,797
You never make the wrong decision.

1354
01:33:30,505 --> 01:33:31,494
Fucking had it.

1355
01:33:31,673 --> 01:33:34,471
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
All right, Cohen, time's up! We're coming in!

1356
01:33:35,243 --> 01:33:36,801
<font color="#808080">HERBERT:</font>
We got a better idea, coppers.

1357
01:33:36,978 --> 01:33:38,502
Why don't you take your guns...

1358
01:33:38,680 --> 01:33:40,807
...and shove them up your asses.

1359
01:33:42,150 --> 01:33:43,742
You call it, sarge.

1360
01:33:46,154 --> 01:33:47,143
Light them up!

1361
01:33:52,927 --> 01:33:54,792
<font color="#808080">HERBERT:</font>
Dirty stinking copper!

1362
01:33:55,030 --> 01:33:56,520
- Where you hiding?<font color="#808080">
MAN:</font> Clear!

1363
01:33:57,499 --> 01:33:59,091
Unh!

1364
01:34:01,636 --> 01:34:02,830
Cover me!

1365
01:34:50,719 --> 01:34:52,584
We gotta take out that gun!

1366
01:34:54,355 --> 01:34:55,379
Watch this, hoss!

1367
01:35:39,601 --> 01:35:41,125
I'm out!

1368
01:36:15,303 --> 01:36:18,795
Elmer's got a plane waiting in Burbank,
but we need to leave now, Mick.

1369
01:36:21,242 --> 01:36:22,971
Can I get my tie on?

1370
01:36:24,679 --> 01:36:28,479
Want my fucking tie straight,
I'm gonna go out there in fucking public.

1371
01:36:29,317 --> 01:36:30,579
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
You all right?

1372
01:36:30,752 --> 01:36:32,117
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
I'm all right.

1373
01:36:32,921 --> 01:36:34,616
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font> Hold on.
- Unh.

1374
01:36:36,157 --> 01:36:38,250
<font color="#808080">JERRY:</font>
Go get that son of a bitch.

1375
01:36:42,597 --> 01:36:43,655
<font color="#D900D9">(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)</font>

1376
01:36:50,171 --> 01:36:51,331
<font color="#D900D9">(GUNSHOT)</font>

1377
01:36:53,808 --> 01:36:55,469
<font color="#808080">KARL:</font>
That you, O'Mara?

1378
01:36:55,643 --> 01:36:57,372
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
That's right, coward!

1379
01:36:57,579 --> 01:36:59,103
Come and get it, Cohen.

1380
01:37:01,015 --> 01:37:03,176
Here comes Santy Claus.

1381
01:37:40,355 --> 01:37:42,346
<font color="#808080">COHEN:</font>
Get the car! Get the car!

1382
01:37:53,501 --> 01:37:55,128
Unh!

1383
01:38:06,214 --> 01:38:07,704
<font color="#808080">RAMIREZ:</font>
Harris, help me out!

1384
01:38:20,061 --> 01:38:21,528
<font color="#808080">COHEN:</font>
Come on, let's go!

1385
01:38:26,367 --> 01:38:28,062
Come on! Drive faster!

1386
01:38:30,738 --> 01:38:32,262
Son of a bitch.

1387
01:38:35,209 --> 01:38:36,801
<font color="#D900D9">(GUNSHOT AND KARL GRUNTS)</font>

1388
01:38:44,385 --> 01:38:45,784
Aah!

1389
01:38:50,491 --> 01:38:52,118
<font color="#D900D9">(GROANING)</font>

1390
01:38:57,432 --> 01:39:00,799
Navidad, come over here and help me aim.

1391
01:39:07,809 --> 01:39:10,972
Remember, not where
the son of a bitch is, goddamn it.

1392
01:39:11,145 --> 01:39:12,840
Where he's gonna be.

1393
01:39:16,451 --> 01:39:17,577
<font color="#D900D9">(GUNSHOT)</font>

1394
01:39:26,094 --> 01:39:28,119
<font color="#D900D9">(PANTING)</font>

1395
01:39:34,369 --> 01:39:36,132
That's my boy.

1396
01:39:50,952 --> 01:39:52,180
Mickey Cohen...

1397
01:39:52,854 --> 01:39:56,551
...you're under arrest for the murder
of Jack Whalen.

1398
01:40:00,028 --> 01:40:02,519
All right, lawman, take me in.

1399
01:40:03,264 --> 01:40:04,322
Come on.

1400
01:40:12,673 --> 01:40:14,868
- Wanna dance?
- Yeah.

1401
01:40:15,043 --> 01:40:16,874
All right, come on.

1402
01:40:28,790 --> 01:40:29,984
You're an interrupter.

1403
01:40:30,725 --> 01:40:32,852
An interrupter of progress.

1404
01:40:34,195 --> 01:40:35,355
I'm progress, see?

1405
01:41:01,889 --> 01:41:02,913
Come on.

1406
01:41:15,536 --> 01:41:17,197
<font color="#D900D9">(POLICE SIREN WAILING)</font>

1407
01:41:28,049 --> 01:41:29,448
Get up! Get up!

1408
01:41:31,252 --> 01:41:33,277
Come on. Come on.

1409
01:41:38,159 --> 01:41:39,285
<font color="#D900D9">(CAMERAS CLICKING)</font>

1410
01:41:50,104 --> 01:41:51,401
<font color="#808080">MAN:</font>
That's Mickey Cohen.

1411
01:41:55,109 --> 01:41:56,599
<font color="#D900D9">(GROANING)</font>

1412
01:42:03,951 --> 01:42:05,441
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
Take him away.

1413
01:42:08,689 --> 01:42:09,678
<font color="#808080">COP:</font>
All right, let's go.

1414
01:42:15,830 --> 01:42:18,264
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
<i>Every man carries a badge.</i>

1415
01:42:18,432 --> 01:42:21,697
<i>Mickey Cohen pledged allegiance
to his own power.</i>

1416
01:42:21,903 --> 01:42:25,168
<i>Violence was his means and his end.</i>

1417
01:42:25,840 --> 01:42:30,436
<i>When he was sent to Alcatraz, friends of
Jack Whalen welcomed him with a lead pipe.</i>

1418
01:42:30,611 --> 01:42:32,101
<font color="#D900D9">(CAMERA CLICKING)</font>

1419
01:42:33,481 --> 01:42:38,145
<i>Parker stayed on as chief of police
until his death in 1966.</i>

1420
01:42:38,486 --> 01:42:41,046
<i>He got credit for Cohen's downfall.</i>

1421
01:42:41,322 --> 01:42:43,950
<i>No one ever spoke of the Gangster Squad.</i>

1422
01:42:45,059 --> 01:42:50,429
<i>The reign of the gangster Mickey Cohen
in Los Angeles is at an end.</i>

1423
01:42:50,698 --> 01:42:52,666
<font color="#808080">O'MARA:</font>
<i>Parker deserved the praise.</i>

1424
01:42:52,833 --> 01:42:56,200
<i>In tough times, he'd kept his oath
to protect and serve...</i>

1425
01:42:56,938 --> 01:43:00,396
<i>...just like the thousands who walk
their beats every day.</i>

1426
01:43:00,575 --> 01:43:02,236
<i>Maybe without glory...</i>

1427
01:43:02,443 --> 01:43:04,070
<i>...but with pride and honor.</i>

1428
01:43:04,378 --> 01:43:05,402
<font color="#D900D9">(BARKS)</font>

1429
01:43:05,580 --> 01:43:09,209
<i>We brought Cohen in, but it was
Grace's testimony that put him away.</i>

1430
01:43:09,984 --> 01:43:13,647
<i>After the trial, she held on to Jerry
and wouldn't let go.</i>

1431
01:43:14,088 --> 01:43:18,184
<i>Jerry always threatened to leave
the force, but he never did.</i>

1432
01:43:18,593 --> 01:43:22,359
<i>I guess he couldn't shake
the call of duty that echoed in his ears.</i>

1433
01:43:23,998 --> 01:43:28,230
<i>Every man carries a badge,
and this was mine.</i>

1434
01:43:29,170 --> 01:43:31,263
<i>But it was time to put it away.</i>

1435
01:43:32,707 --> 01:43:36,006
<i>The mob has never had
a foothold in Los Angeles.</i>

1436
01:43:36,177 --> 01:43:38,907
<i>I'd like to think I played
a small role in that.</i>

1437
01:43:40,214 --> 01:43:44,344
<i>I may not be in the line of fire anymore,
but I still love my town.</i>

1438
01:43:45,753 --> 01:43:47,618
<i>It's not paradise...</i>

1439
01:43:48,089 --> 01:43:49,852
<i>...but it is the City of Angels.</i>

1440
01:52:50,330 --> 01:52:52,321
<font color="#D900D9">(English - US - SDH)</font>
